We have engineers working night and day on the captured relic - but they need protection from the Russian enemy. You must protect them long enough for their work to reach a stage where they can build a copy of the device.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Protect the hangar where the engineers are, at all costs.
- Respond to new situations as they arise.

PDA TIP:
Press X in a mission to open the PDA, then [ or ] to change pages. OPTIONS turns Subtitles on or off and changes their size.